          <strong>Raleigh Community Kickstand</strong>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" align="center"> Fix. Teach. Give. </mj-text>

        <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" align="center">
